# Studio deviations for this benchmark - recommendation <tab> reason. The fix leaves these
# alone, the check still runs and reports "exception" with the reason.
6.2.3.3	sudo-rs, Ubuntu 26.04's sudo, has no logfile option (the benchmark says so in 5.2.3), so there is no sudo log file to watch. sudo events go to the persistent journal (5.2.3 accepts that), and the audit rules of 6.2.3.1/6.2.3.2 record sudoers changes and actions run as another user.
